	)
	(text_box "Note that this component is not a repeater.\nEnabled channels add bus capacitance and pull-up resistors. Assuming the master-side I2C pull-ups are 4.7 kΩ, the total pull-up resistance when one channel is enabled is 2.35 kΩ."
